From f9cb180cc4bd5ed90218752c9f45b82627622858 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Beyley Cardellio <ep1cm1n10n123@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:20:11 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 58/63] t/constellation: Add a second relation history for
 keyframes

This allows exact unpredicted keyframe poses to be grabbed if available for slow cameras after other cameras have been solved.

Signed-off-by: Beyley Cardellio <ep1cm1n10n123@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/monado/monado/-/merge_requests/3104>
